# Income & Expenditure & Receipt Payment System

Financial management platform for SMEs in Accra, Ghana.

Developer: Awarkano Kofi John | BTech Computing | Database A+ | jawarkano@gmail.com

## Features
- Role-Based Access (Admin, Cashier, Accountant)
- Automated Receipt Generation with QR
- Income & Expenditure Tracking Dashboard
- Payment Reconciliation - Mobile Money, Bank, Cash
- PostgreSQL/MySQL with transaction logging
- Financial Reports - Daily, Monthly, Yearly

## Tech Stack
Django, PostgreSQL, MySQL, React, Bootstrap

## Impact
12+ SMEs, 70% error reduction, 15 hours/week saved
